# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECURITY: every NEXT_PUBLIC_* variable is inlined into the browser bundle
# and visible to anyone who opens DevTools. Never put a value here that you
# are not comfortable publishing — especially no Alchemy/Infura API keys.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OPTIONAL — direct-from-browser RPC endpoint appended to the public-endpoint
# fallback chain. Must be an endpoint you are comfortable exposing publicly
# (e.g. a URL with per-request referer restrictions, or no key at all).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR-PUBLIC-KEY

# OPTIONAL — RECOMMENDED for any key you need to keep private. Server-only
# (never bundled): the same-origin Route Handler at /api/rpc forwards browser
# requests here, caches immutable reads (mined txs / receipts / blocks), and
# applies a 15s timeout per upstream call.
RPC_URL=
